<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left"><SUP STYLE="font-size:75%; vertical-align:top">(1)</SUP>&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">During the second fiscal quarter of 2025, the Company refined its methodology to report <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-GAAP</FONT> measures. The change does not impact the Company&#8217;s financial position, cash flows, or GAAP consolidated results of operations. Prior period <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-GAAP</FONT> financial
measures presented in this press release have been recast to conform to the current presentation. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left"><SUP STYLE="font-size:75%; vertical-align:top">(2)</SUP>&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">The total number of shares used to calculate earnings per share in Q1 increased to 190.7 million, primarily
because of accounting rules that require us to include our Series B Preferred Shares as if they were converted into common shares. As part of this calculation, we also added back the preferred cash dividend to earnings used to calculate diluted
earnings per share. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">15 </P>

